title: Kitty
---
Kitty: Oh! You made it across, but the ice bridge collapsed right after you stepped off it! #line:0b04c9d 
Kitty: That must've been scary. I'm so glad you're okay. #line:01332d3 
-> I came to invite you to a party! #line:010632c 
    Kitty: A party? That sounds wonderful! I'd love to come and bring my balloons! #line:098f70f 
    Kitty: But... after you crossed, the ice bridge broke. I can't reach my balloons anymore. #line:0762ac0 
    Kitty: Would you help me gather my balloons from across the water?  #line:0047426 
    Kitty: I'll share my ice magic so you can build paths! #line:0a9ae0d 
    <<start_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
-> Are you Kitty? #line:0512d87 
    Kitty: That's me! I live in that little igloo over there, and I love meeting new friends. #line:0f65c5b 
    Kitty: I was just worrying about the balloons. They drifted away across the lake... #line:09523de 
    -> Can I help you get them back? #line:0538911 
        Kitty: Really? That makes me so happy! #line:0fdebea 
        Kitty: If you help me gather the balloons, I'll come for sure. I'll even lend you my ice power! #line:0a41b63 
        <<start_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
-> I'll come back later #line:033defa 
    Kitty: I'm glad you're safe, see you in a bit! #line:0e4851e 
===
title: Kitty_InProgress
---
Kitty: Keep going, you're doing great! I'll be waiting for you. #line:0b213c2 
===
title: Kitty_Complete
---
Kitty: You found them all! Thank you so much. #line:05499cc 
Kitty: I can't wait to come to your party. I'll bring all the balloons! #line:0554487 
<<complete_quest "Frozen Balloons">>
